  },
  {
    "document_id": "syn-parse-docx-001",
    "sha256": "cd73ea5546189d402b021200e873e61a227d5d37fa9c18c4bd2908e465b72c63",
    "parser_version": "1.0",
    "block_id": "f28ee3e4c5372f7c",
    "locator": {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph_index": 4
    },
    "text": "以上成绩仅供参考。实际成绩以教务系统公布为准。如有疑问，请在成绩公布后10个工作日内向所在学院提出复核申请。"
  },
  {
    "document_id": "syn-parse-docx-001",
